Daily station event files — contents not tracked in git (see .gitignore)
=========================================================================

The shipped configuration's General.Station_Events.Directory. The application exports one file per
local date here, 'YYYY-MM-DD.csv' (Logger/Station_Events.py); the mode file's comment on that field
says how to read them. An installation points the field at the directory the external system reads.
The directory must exist for the configuration to load, which is why this file keeps it.
